<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Boral says 1st four month profit down.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Boral says 1st four month profit down.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Building products group Boral Ltd said on Monday that its operating profit in the first four months of the current 1996/97 year was in line with budget and about 20 percent below year ago levels.</p>
<p>But the company also said earnings in the first six months of 1996/97 would be substantially above that achieved in the second half of 1995/96.</p>
</text>
